    !> an incomplete LU factorization. \p tol is used to determine whether a numerical value
    !> is replaced by \p boost_val, such that \f$A_{j,j} = \text{boost_val}\f$ if
    !> \f$\text{tol} &ge; \left|A_{j,j}\right|\f$.
