    !> \ref rocsparse_scsrsv_buffer_size "rocsparse_Xcsrsv_buffer_size()" if the matrix sparsity
    !> pattern
    !> is identical. The user-allocated buffer can therefore be shared between subsequent calls to
    !> those functions.
