    ! rocsparse_scheck_matrix_csc
    !---------------------------------------------
    !> \ingroup utility_module
    !> \brief Check matrix to see if it is valid.
    !>
    !> \details
    !> \p rocsparse_check_matrix_csc checks if the input CSC matrix is valid. It performs basic
